/* generated from exten : {A,B,u,v:tm (depprod A [x:tm A]B x)}{p:ded (equal A (deppi1 A ([x:tm A]B x) u) (deppi1 A ([x:tm A]B x) v))}ded (equal (B (deppi1 A ([x:tm A]B x) v)) (transport (B (deppi1 A ([x:tm A]B x) u)) (B (deppi1 A ([x:tm A]B x) v)) (congTp A (deppi1 A ([x:tm A]B x) u) (deppi1 A ([x:tm A]B x) v) p B) (deppi2 A ([x:tm A]B x) u)) (deppi2 A ([x:tm A]B x) v))⟶ded (equal (depprod A [x:tm A]B x) u v) */

ded X2 (equal (depprod A x \ B x) u v) :- help/exten A B u v p X1 X2 , ded X1 (equal (B (deppi1 A (x \ B x) v)) (transport (B (deppi1 A (x \ B x) u)) (B (deppi1 A (x \ B x) v)) (congTp A (deppi1 A (x \ B x) u) (deppi1 A (x \ B x) v) p B) (deppi2 A (x \ B x) u)) (deppi2 A (x \ B x) v)).

help/exten A B u v p (prodcert X1/1 X1/2) (prodcert X2/1 X2/2) :- help/exten A B u v p X1/1 X2/1 , help/exten A B u v p X1/2 X2/2.

help/exten A B u v p (idcert X1) (idcert X2) :- X2 > 0 , X1 is X2 - 1.

help/exten A B u v p (ptcert X1) (ptcert (exten A B u v p X1)).

